              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me wac pa Rwoth m'obino ri Yeremia wok bongi Rwoth, munyo kere Zedekia odhiro rigo Pasur wod pa Malikia kodi jacway ri Were i wi migam Zefania wod pa Maseya, ka waco ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
