          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Yeremia owaco rijo ni: Wibino waco ri Zefania ama: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth waco ama, Were pa Isiraili: “Zedekia, akidho kikengila jolweny perin ma jolwenyo kodi kere ma Babilon kodi jolweny pere ma jothoko win woko ma cel. Alakelo jo kanyacel i dier tindi madwoŋ me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An won gipi alalweny gi win gi cingan m'oyare gi badan ma meni, i nge, aŋedha cuny kodi i keme madwoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaneko woko joma bedo i tindi madwoŋ me, ji kodi ogwaŋe; jolatho i two nundu madwoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rumacen mere, Rwoth waco, alamiyo kere Zedekia ma Yuda, gi ŋecin pere, kodi ji ma tindi madwoŋ me, jono ma joboth two nundu, abor kodi kec i cingi kere Nebukadineza ma Babilon, i cingi jokwor pajo, i cingi joma dwaro kwo pajo. Go bino neko jo g'abor mabith; go k'omaki gi jo wor, kosa k'okoy jo, kosa k'omaki wor.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo to Rwoth waco ran ni awaci ri ji ni, “E, aketho ruwaŋ win royo ma kwo kodi royo ma tho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jono ma jobedo i tindi madwoŋ me jolatho g'abor, kec kodi two nundu; to jono ma jotiŋ cingi jo malo ri Jobabilon ma jothoko win jolakwo aka jolabedo gi kwo pajo paka kemba ma lweny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole atieko como waŋan kwoŋ tindi madwoŋ me ro gimarac makiweno ro bero, Rwoth waco. Abino ketho i cingi kere ma Babilon, aka go bino waŋo woko gi mac.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Thumo banja kwoŋ ot pa kere ma Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
